<title>USA: Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Wednesday 105,000-USDA.</title>
<headline>Iowa-So Minn hogs estimate Wednesday 105,000-USDA.</headline>
<dateline>DES MOINES 1997-04-16</dateline>
<text>
<p>USDA said Wednesday's est receipts 105,000, Wk ago 100,000, and Yr ago 107,000 head at interior Iowa/so Minnesota. Estimates include generally about 65 percent Carcass Base Hogs. Barrows and gilts traded $1.00 higher than mid-session Tuesday. Trade was slow to moderate for good demand and light to moderate offerings. Top $55.00 per cwt.</p>
